            <div class="step5-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Strengths</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/mandala-2.png">
                <p><strong>They Are The Best Fun</strong></p>
                <p>Jesters are the funniest and the most entertaining of all the archetypes.  They are especially so when they have overcome their greatest challenge and have learned how to live a balanced and deeply fulfilling life.  When they do this, the Jester becomes a force to be reckoned with and unsurprisingly popular amongst those around him or her.</p>
                <p><strong>Has Sharp Wit And High Intellect</strong></p>
                <p>Most people don’t stop to notice how sharp and intelligent the Jester is.  But they wouldn’t be able to come up with such genius and funny jokes without their mental agility, and they certainly wouldn’t be able to entertain with it.  Sarcasm, irony, or just generally amusing jokes are all simple for a Jester.</p>
                <p><strong>Notices The Intricate Details Of Life</strong></p>
                <p>Jester’s are like artists in the way that they view the world.  They notice the tiny little details of life, human behavior, and society.  They don’t leave any stone unturned, which is why they can make such fabulous jokes.</p>
                <p><strong>Charismatic</strong></p>
                <p>As you’d expect from a Jester, as long as they are not making themselves the Joke, they can be incredibly charismatic, and when they use this superpower to their fullest potential the world is their oyster!</p>
                
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Weaknesses</h2>
                <p><strong>Highly Self Critical</strong></p>
                <p>Jester’s are extremely self-critical, the irony in which they view in life is the same irony they use when they consider themselves, and they can be extremely harsh on themselves.</p>
                <p>This habit causes the Jester to feel insecure because they are so critical of themselves.</p>
                <p>Consequently, they often feel as though they have to hide themselves, and they do this very easily by using their sharp eyes and smart jokes.</p>
                <p>Laugh at the Jesters self-deprecating jokes, and they will take it personally, don’t laugh and they’ll take that personally too! You can’t win unless they decide to stop criticizing themselves so much.</p>
                <p><strong>Gets Bored Easily</strong></p>
                <p>Jesters easily become bored. Boredom is a challenge that the Jester will have to work to fight most of their life if they want to get things done.  Otherwise, it’s far too easy for the Jester to seek out more entertaining things to do at the cost of living a normal and balanced life.</p>
                <p>Hedonism in any sense is not off the cards for the Jester.  If left unmanaged this can make the Jester fail in their work or become unkempt and unhealthy.</p>
                <p><strong>Can Become Apathetic Easily</strong></p>
                <p>Because the Jester has such a sharp eye and notices all of the little quirks in life, they probably notice a lot of darkness that seems to be ever present in our world.  This darkness will not be lost on a Jester, they will take it all in, and in some cases, they can start to become overwhelmed or even disappointed in the world. </p>
                <p>Combine that problem with their ability to get bored so quickly and their fragile ego then it’s easy to see how a Jester can become so apathetic.</p>
                <p>Even if they still manage to make a joke or raise a smile while they are feeling this way.</p>
                <p><strong>Can Use Humour or Sarcasm To Gain The Upper Hand Amongst Others.</strong></p>
                <p>Jesters use their humor and sharp wit as their greatest asset which indeed it is. However, they don’t always use it for good, they use it to hide, and how they feel, and they can also use it in a passive aggressive manner to communicate to others that they don’t like them too much.</p>
                <p>This can make a Jester tricky to be around, as people never know if they are really joking or if there is some truth behind their jokes. </p>
                <p>Maybe this is where the saying ‘many a true word is said in jest’ comes from.</p>
